## CodeGraph

Use `codegraph_explore` first for structural questions about indexed code and
Markdown. Name a file or symbol in the query to read its current source.
`codegraph_sessions` searches earlier agent sessions.

Detailed tool behavior, indexed-file coverage, freshness and fallback rules live
in [`src/mcp/server-instructions.ts`](../../src/mcp/server-instructions.ts).
Follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) for this repository's project safeguards.

If `.codegraph/` does not exist, use built-in tools. Indexing is the user's
decision; do not run `codegraph init` without their direction.
